These files carry their original copyright headers and have been modified only
as needed to vendor them: import paths were repointed, Qformer.py gained a
compatibility shim so it works across transformers versions, and eva_vit.py now
imports three helpers from disenq/models/layers.py instead of from timm. LAVIS
credits the EVA, BEiT, timm, DeiT and DINO codebases for eva_vit.py; see that
file's header.

Additionally, disenq/models/layers.py reimplements three small helpers whose
stochastic-depth formulation follows pytorch-image-models (timm), Apache
License 2.0 — https://github.com/huggingface/pytorch-image-models


